       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QTC04.
      * COMPANY BO - DIRECT AND INDIRECT SHAREHOLDING
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIRECT-SHARES          PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-VIA-ENTITY-PCT         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-ENTITY-HOLDS-PCT       PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CAPITAL                PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-PROFITS                PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TOTAL-SHARES           PIC 9(5)V9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-OTHER-CONTROL          PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-IS-BO                  PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-DIRECT-SHARES
           ACCEPT WS-VIA-ENTITY-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-ENTITY-HOLDS-PCT
           ACCEPT WS-CAPITAL
           ACCEPT WS-PROFITS
           ACCEPT WS-OTHER-CONTROL
           PERFORM 2000-EFFECTIVE
           DISPLAY 'BO: ' WS-IS-BO
           STOP RUN.
       2000-EFFECTIVE.
      * INDIRECT INTEREST THROUGH A JURIDICAL PERSON IS MULTIPLIED OUT.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-SHARES = WS-DIRECT-SHARES +
                   (WS-VIA-ENTITY-PCT * WS-ENTITY-HOLDS-PCT / 100)
           IF WS-TOTAL-SHARES > 25 OR WS-CAPITAL > 25
              OR WS-PROFITS > 25 OR WS-OTHER-CONTROL = 'Y'
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-IS-BO
           ELSE
              MOVE 'N' TO WS-IS-BO
           END-IF.
